@startuml
!include r4-sequence-style.puml
title FE-12 Configure and Save Design Version
actor "Member" as Actor
participant "<<view>>\n:DesignPages" as Pages
participant "<<controller>>\n:WorkshopRingDesignController" as Controller
participant "<<service>>\n:WorkshopRingDesignApplicationService" as Service
participant "<<facade>>\n:DesignRuleFacade" as RuleFacade
participant "<<repository>>\n:RingDesignRepository" as DesignRepo
participant "<<repository>>\n:RingDesignIdempotencyRecordRepository" as IdempotencyRepo
participant "<<database>>\n:MySQL Database" as DB

Actor -> Pages : Save model or blank parameters
activate Pages
Pages -> Controller : POST design + Idempotency-Key
activate Controller
Controller -> Service : validate Member, key and version
activate Service
Service -> RuleFacade : validate catalogue options and limits
activate RuleFacade
RuleFacade --> Service : valid snapshot and rules version
deactivate RuleFacade
Service -> DesignRepo : save immutable version
activate DesignRepo
DesignRepo -> DB : INSERT ring design version
DB --> DesignRepo : saved design version
DesignRepo --> Service : saved design version
deactivate DesignRepo
Service -> IdempotencyRepo : record command result
activate IdempotencyRepo
IdempotencyRepo -> DB : INSERT idempotency record
DB --> IdempotencyRepo : command recorded
IdempotencyRepo --> Service : command recorded
deactivate IdempotencyRepo
Service --> Controller : SAVED design and safe summary
deactivate Service
Controller --> Pages : HTTP 201 / HTTP 409
deactivate Controller
Pages --> Actor : Display saved design and workshop recommendation
deactivate Pages
note over Actor,Pages
Guest can preview locally, but protected save requires sign-in.
end note
@enduml
